| title       = "Cold Heart (Pnau remix)" (2021)
| description = A 16-second sample of "Cold Heart (Pnau Remix)", featuring an interpolation of [[Elton John]]'s single "[[Rocket Man (song)|Rocket Man]]" (1972) with vocals from [[Dua Lipa]].<ref name="Walthall" />
| format      = [[Ogg]]
| pos         = 
}}
"Cold Heart (Pnau remix)" was written by John, Andrew Meecham, [[Bernie Taupin]], Dean Meredith, [[Nick Littlemore|Nicholas Littlemore]], [[Peter Mayes]] and [[Sam Littlemore]], with the production completed by the latter three, who form the group [[Pnau]].<ref name="Spotify">{{cite web |publisher=[[Spotify]] |title=Cold Heart (PNAU Remix){{spaced ndash}}Song by Elton John and Dua Lipa  |url=https://open.spotify.com/album/5D8Rdb09BkmHscEGSWAlA6 |access-date=5 February 2023 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230205200408/https://open.spotify.com/album/5D8Rdb09BkmHscEGSWAlA6 |archive-date=5 February 2023 |date=13 August 2021 |url-status=live}} ''Note: Click on the three dots on the right of the track to display the credits.''</ref> The song has a duration time of three minutes and 22 seconds and was composed in the [[time signature]] of {{music|time|4|4}} and the [[Key (music)|key]] of [[B-flat minor]], with a [[tempo]] of 116 beats per minute.<ref name="Release">Citations regarding the release of "Cold Heart (Pnau remix)" by Elton John and Dua Lipa in various selected countries:
* {{cite web |publisher=[[Apple Music]] (Australia) |title=Cold Heart (Pnau remix){{spaced ndash}}Single by Elton John and Dua Lipa |url=https://music.apple.com/us/album/cold-heart-pnau-remix-single/1578986656 |access-date=5 February 2023 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230205141712/https://music.apple.com/us/album/cold-heart-pnau-remix-single/1578986656 |archive-date=5 February 2023 |date=13 August 2021 |url-status=live}}
* {{cite web |publisher=Apple Music (Canada) |title=Cold Heart (Pnau remix){{spaced ndash}}Single by Elton John and Dua Lipa |url=https://music.apple.com/ca/album/cold-heart-pnau-remix-single/1578986656 |access-date=5 February 2023 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230205141929/https://music.apple.com/ca/album/cold-heart-pnau-remix-single/1578986656 |archive-date=5 February 2023 |date=13 August 2021 |url-status=live}}
* {{cite web |publisher=Apple Music (Kosovo) |title=Cold Heart (Pnau remix){{spaced ndash}}Single by Elton John and Dua Lipa |url=https://music.apple.com/xk/album/cold-heart-pnau-remix-single/1578986656 |access-date=5 February 2023 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230205142046/https://music.apple.com/xk/album/cold-heart-pnau-remix-single/1578986656 |archive-date=5 February 2023 |date=13 August 2021 |url-status=live}}
* {{cite web |publisher=Apple Music (United Kingdom) |title=Cold Heart (Pnau remix){{spaced ndash}}Single by Elton John and Dua Lipa |url=https://music.apple.com/gb/album/cold-heart-pnau-remix-single/1578986656 |access-date=5 February 2023 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230205142154/https://music.apple.com/gb/album/cold-heart-pnau-remix-single/1578986656 |archive-date=5 February 2023 |date=13 August 2021 |url-status=live}}</ref><ref name="Musicnotes">{{cite web |website=Musicnotes.com |title=Elton John and Dua Lipa 'Cold Heart' Sheet Music |date=31 August 2021 |url=https://www.musicnotes.com/sheetmusic/mtd.asp?ppn=MN0240705 |access-date=8 February 2023 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230208154918/https://www.musicnotes.com/sheetmusic/mtd.asp?ppn=MN0240705 |archive-date=8 February 2023 |url-status=live}}</ref> The song is constructed in the [[verse–chorus form]] and uses the [[chord progression]] B♭m7–E♭m7–G♭-Fm7.<ref name="Musicnotes" /> The song was released for [[Music download|digital download]] and [[Streaming media|streaming]] in various countries by [[EMI Records|EMI]] and [[Mercury Records|Mercury]] on 13 August 2021 as the [[lead single]] from John's 32nd studio album ''[[The Lockdown Sessions (Elton John album)|The Lockdown Sessions]]'' (2021).<ref name="Release" /> Paying homage to John's career, it [[Interpolation (popular music)|interpolates]] his songs "[[Rocket Man (song)|Rocket Man]]" (1972), "[[Kiss the Bride (song)|Kiss the Bride]]" (1983), "[[Sacrifice (Elton John song)|Sacrifice]]" (1989) and "[[Blue Moves|Where's the Shoorah]]?" (1976).<ref name="Walthall">{{cite magazine |last=Walthall |first=Catherine |magazine=[[American Songwriter]] |title=Story and Meaning Behind the Song Lyrics: 'Cold Heart,' Elton John and Dua Lipa |url=https://americansongwriter.com/meaning-behind-cold-heart-elton-john-dua-lipa/ |access-date=7 February 2023 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230207195536/https://americansongwriter.com/meaning-behind-cold-heart-elton-john-dua-lipa/ |archive-date=7 February 2023 |date=23 March 2022 |url-status=live}}</ref><ref name="Legaspi">{{cite magazine |last=Legaspi |first=Althea |magazine=Rolling Stone |title=Elton John, Dua Lipa Team Up for New 'Cold Heart (Pnau Remix)' |url=https://www.rollingstone.com/music/music-news/dua-lipa-elton-john-cold-heart-pnau-remix-1211136/ |access-date=7 February 2023 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230207194605/https://www.rollingstone.com/music/music-news/dua-lipa-elton-john-cold-heart-pnau-remix-1211136/ |archive-date=7 February 2023 |date=13 August 2021 |url-status=live}}</ref><ref name="Amter">{{cite magazine |last=Amter |first=Charlie |magazine=[[Variety (magazine)|Variety]] |title=Hitmaker of the Month: With 'Cold Heart,' Australia's Pnau Reaches Career Peak Reimagining Elton John Classics |url=https://variety.com/2022/music/news/pnau-elton-john-dua-lipa-cold-heart-1235161203/ |access-date=7 February 2023 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230207195144/https://variety.com/2022/music/news/pnau-elton-john-dua-lipa-cold-heart-1235161203/ |archive-date=7 February 2023 |date=24 January 2022 |url-status=live}}</ref> The sample of "Where's the Shoorah?" appears at the 3:19 mark, with a tempo from 116 BPM to 130 BPM and a key shifted from an [[E-flat major]] to [[B-flat minor]].<ref>{{cite magazine |last=Greene |first=Andy |magazine=Rolling Stone |title=Flashback: Hear the 1976 Elton John Obscurity Sampled in Current Hit 'Cold Heart' |url=https://www.rollingstone.com/music/music-news/elton-john-dua-lipa-cold-heart-pnau-remix-wheres-the-shoorah-1282616/ |access-date=12 February 2023 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221212052229/https://www.rollingstone.com/music/music-news/elton-john-dua-lipa-cold-heart-pnau-remix-wheres-the-shoorah-1282616/ |archive-date=12 December 2022 |date=11 January 2022 |url-status=live}}</ref> "Cold Heart (Pnau remix)" is an [[Upbeat (music)|upbeat]],<ref>{{cite web |publisher=Radio Arena |title=Elton John & Dua Lipa 'Cold Heart' (Pnau Remix) |work=Rádio Arena |url=https://radioarena.pt/elton-john-dua-lipa-cold-heart/ |access-date=11 February 2023 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230211225435/https://radioarena.pt/elton-john-dua-lipa-cold-heart/ |archive-date=11 February 2023 |language=pt |date=19 August 2021 |url-status=live}}</ref> contemporary [[synth-pop]],<ref name="Amsler">{{cite web |last=Amsler |first=Jose-Luis |publisher=Musik Express |title=Elton John feat. Dua Lipa: So klingt ihr gemeinsames Duett 'Cold Heart' |url=https://www.musikexpress.de/elton-john-feat-dua-lipa-so-klingt-ihr-gemeinsames-duett-cold-heart-1990685/ |access-date=7 February 2023 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230207200501/https://www.musikexpress.de/elton-john-feat-dua-lipa-so-klingt-ihr-gemeinsames-duett-cold-heart-1990685/ |archive-date=7 February 2023 |language=de |date=13 August 2021 |url-status=live}}</ref> [[Dance music|dance]], [[dance-pop]] and [[pop music|pop]] song,<ref name="Robledo">{{cite web |last=Robledo |first=Jordan |work=[[Gay Times]] |title=Dua Lipa and Elton John team up on new Cold Heart (Pnau Remix) single |date=13 August 2021 |url=https://www.gaytimes.co.uk/music/dua-lipa-and-elton-john-team-up-on-new-cold-heart-pnau-remix-single/ |access-date=7 February 2023 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230207201624/https://www.gaytimes.co.uk/music/dua-lipa-and-elton-john-team-up-on-new-cold-heart-pnau-remix-single/ |archive-date=7 February 2023 |url-status=live}}</ref><ref name="Aniftos">{{cite magazine |last=Aniftos |first=Rania |magazine=[[Billboard (magazine)|Billboard]] |title=Here Are the Lyrics to Elton John & Dua Lipa's 'Cold Heart (PNAU Remix)' |url=https://www.billboard.com/music/lyrics/elton-john-dua-lipa-cold-heart-lyrics-1235024278/ |access-date=7 February 2023 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230207201403/https://www.billboard.com/music/lyrics/elton-john-dua-lipa-cold-heart-lyrics-1235024278/ |archive-date=7 February 2023 |date=27 January 2022 |url-status=live}}</ref><ref name="Chirilă">{{cite web |last=Chirilă |first=Raluca |publisher=InfoMusic |title=Elton John & Dua Lipa{{spaced ndash}}Cold Heart (Pnau Remix) |url=https://www.infomusic.ro/videoclip/elton-john-si-dua-lipa-cold-heart-pnau-remix/ |access-date=11 February 2023 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230211133559/https://www.infomusic.ro/videoclip/elton-john-si-dua-lipa-cold-heart-pnau-remix/ |archive-date=11 February 2023 |language=ro |date=13 August 2021 |url-status=live}}</ref> with [[Electronic dance music|club]], disco and [[house music|house]] beats.<ref name="Rowley">{{cite web |last=Rowley |first=Glenn |work=[[Consequence (publication)|Consequence]] |title=Dua Lipa and Elton John Unveil New Collaboration 'Cold Heart (Pnau Remix)': Stream |url=https://consequence.net/2021/08/dua-lipa-elton-john-cold-heart-pnau-remix-stream/ |access-date=11 February 2023 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230211132122/https://consequence.net/2021/08/dua-lipa-elton-john-cold-heart-pnau-remix-stream/ |archive-date=11 February 2023 |date=13 August 2021 |url-status=live}}</ref><ref>{{cite web |last=Kennedy |first=John R. |publisher=iHeart |title='Cold Heart (Pnau Remix)' Was This Year's Biggest Song In Canada |url=https://www.iheartradio.ca/news/cold-heart-pnau-remix-was-this-year-s-biggest-song-in-canada-1.18874067 |access-date=11 February 2023 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230211223711/https://www.iheartradio.ca/news/cold-heart-pnau-remix-was-this-year-s-biggest-song-in-canada-1.18874067 |archive-date=11 February 2023 |date=2 December 2022 |url-status=live}}</ref> The lyrics transmit the [[Refrain|chorus]] from "Rocket Man", which includes "And I think it's gonna be a long, long time 'til touchdown brings me 'round again to find / I'm not the man they think I am at home", and verses from "Sacrifice", such as "Cold, cold heart / hardened by you / Some things look better baby / Just passing through".<ref name="Aswad">{{cite magazine |last=Aswad |first=Jem |magazine=Variety |title=How Elton John and Dua Lipa's 'Cold Heart' Pulsed to Life{{spaced ndash}}and Became a Surprise Global Hit |url=https://variety.com/2022/music/features/elton-john-dua-lipa-cold-heart-hitmakers-of-the-year-1235444170/ |access-date=11 February 2023 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230211080012/https://variety.com/2022/music/features/elton-john-dua-lipa-cold-heart-hitmakers-of-the-year-1235444170/ |archive-date=11 February 2023 |url-status=live}}</ref><ref name="WRMF">{{cite web |publisher=[[WRMF]] |title=Listen to Dua Lipa & Elton John mash up four of his songs in new dance remix 'Cold Heart' |date=13 August 2021 |url=https://www.wrmf.com/listen-to-dua-lipa-elton-john-mash-up-four-of-his-songs-in-new-dance-remix-cold-heart/ |access-date=11 February 2023 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230211133858/https://www.wrmf.com/listen-to-dua-lipa-elton-john-mash-up-four-of-his-songs-in-new-dance-remix-cold-heart/ |archive-date=11 February 2023 |url-status=live}}</ref> They describe a relationship that has taken a turn for the worse due to the hardening of the singer's heart.<ref name="Walthall" />

In the United Kingdom, "Cold Heart (Pnau remix)" debuted at number 33 on the [[UK singles chart]] in the issue dated 26 August 2021.<ref name="UK Chart">{{cite web |publisher=Official Charts Company (OCC) |title=Elton John & Dua Lipa |url=https://www.officialcharts.com/artist/60853/elton-john-and-dua-lipa/ |access-date=11 February 2023 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230211140657/https://www.officialcharts.com/artist/60853/elton-john-and-dua-lipa/ |archive-date=11 February 2023 |url-status=live}}</ref> The song reached number one, having spent three consecutive weeks at number two, with sales of 64,000, including 5.9 million streams and 5,000 copies on limited edition CD single, in its ninth week on the chart on 21 October.<ref name="UK Chart" /><ref name="United Kingdom" /><ref name="Ainsley">{{cite web |last=Ainsley |first=Helen |publisher=Official Charts Company (OCC) |title=Elton John and Dua Lipa's Cold Heart (Pnau Remix) claims Number 1 on the Official Singles Chart |url=https://www.officialcharts.com/chart-news/elton-john-and-dua-lipa-s-cold-heart-pnau-remix-claims-number-1-on-the-official-singles-chart__34232/ |access-date=11 February 2023 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230211141308/https://www.officialcharts.com/chart-news/elton-john-and-dua-lipa-s-cold-heart-pnau-remix-claims-number-1-on-the-official-singles-chart__34232/ |archive-date=11 February 2023 |date=15 October 2021 |url-status=live}}</ref> It represented Lipa's third chart-topping single in the UK, after "[[New Rules]]" (2017) and "[[One Kiss (song)|One Kiss]]" (2018), and John's eighth and first in 16 years, since he was featured artist on American rapper [[Tupac Shakur|2Pac]]'s posthumous single "[[Ghetto Gospel]]" (2005).<ref name="Ainsley" /> John also became the first solo artist to achieve a top 10 single in six different decades, spanning from the [[1970s in music|1970s]] to the [[2020s in music|2020s]].<ref>{{cite web |last=Copsey |first=Rob |publisher=Official Charts Company (OCC) |title=Elton John sets new Official Uk Chart record as the first artist to score a Top 10 single in six different decades |url=https://www.officialcharts.com/chart-news/elton-john-sets-new-official-uk-chart-record-as-the-first-artist-to-score-a-top-10-single-in-six-different-decades__34213/ |access-date=11 February 2023 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221121113826/https://www.officialcharts.com/chart-news/elton-john-sets-new-official-uk-chart-record-as-the-first-artist-to-score-a-top-10-single-in-six-different-decades__34213/ |archive-date=21 November 2022 |date=13 October 2021 |url-status=live}}</ref> In April 2023, the song received triple platinum certification from the [[British Phonographic Industry]] (BPI) for shifting more than 1,800,000 units in the UK.<ref name="United Kingdom Cert" /> In Australia, "Cold Heart (Pnau remix)" reached number one on the [[ARIA Charts|ARIA Singles Chart]] for 10 consecutive weeks as well as number one on the [[Official New Zealand Music Chart|New Zealand Singles Chart]] in New Zealand.<ref name="Australia" /><ref>{{cite web |publisher=ARIA |title=Elton John & Dua Lipa hit ten weeks at #1 with Cold Heart (Pnau Remix) |url=https://www.aria.com.au/charts/news/elton-john-dua-lipa-hit-ten-weeks-at-1-with-cold-heart-pnau-remix |access-date=11 February 2023 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230211211723/https://www.aria.com.au/charts/news/elton-john-dua-lipa-hit-ten-weeks-at-1-with-cold-heart-pnau-remix |archive-date=11 February 2023 |date=25 February 2022 |url-status=live}}</ref><ref name="New Zealand" /> The song marked Lipa's first chart-topping single in Australia as well as John's first one since "[[Something About the Way You Look Tonight]]" / "[[Candle in the Wind 1997]]" in 1997.<ref>{{cite web |publisher=ARIA |title=Elton John claims record-breaking Aria #1 single |url=https://www.aria.com.au/charts/news/elton-john-claims-record-breaking-aria-1-single |access-date=11 February 2023 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220802102836/https://www.aria.com.au/charts/news/elton-john-claims-record-breaking-aria-1-single |archive-date=2 August 2022 |date=5 November 2021 |url-status=live}}</ref> Also in 2022, it garnered a ten-times platinum certification from [[Recorded Music NZ|Recorded Music New Zealand]] (RMNZ) in New Zealand for selling more than 300,000 units.<ref name="New Zealand Cert" /> In Australia, it was certified fifteen-times platinum by the [[Australian Recording Industry Association]] (ARIA) for selling 1,050,000 equivalent units.<ref name="Australia Cert" />

In Canada, "Cold Heart (Pnau remix)" reached number one on the [[Canadian Hot 100]] in the issue dated 8 January 2022, having spent a total of 12 consecutive weeks.<ref name="Canada" /><ref>Citations regarding the number one positions of "Cold Heart (Pnau remix)" by Elton John and Dua Lipa in the Canadian Hot 100 ranking:
