* {{cite web |magazine=Billboard |title=Billboard Canadian Hot 100: Week of March 5, 2022 |url=https://www.billboard.com/charts/canadian-hot-100/2022-03-05/ |access-date=11 February 2023 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230211220237/https://www.billboard.com/charts/canadian-hot-100/2022-03-05/ |archive-date=11 February 2023 |url-status=live}}
* {{cite web |magazine=Billboard |title=Billboard Canadian Hot 100: Week of March 12, 2022 |url=https://www.billboard.com/charts/canadian-hot-100/2022-03-12/ |access-date=11 February 2023 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230211220245/https://www.billboard.com/charts/canadian-hot-100/2022-03-12/ |archive-date=11 February 2023 |url-status=live}}
* {{cite web |magazine=Billboard |title=Billboard Canadian Hot 100: Week of March 19, 2022 |url=https://www.billboard.com/charts/canadian-hot-100/2022-03-19/ |access-date=11 February 2023 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221222034048/https://www.billboard.com/charts/canadian-hot-100/2022-03-19/ |archive-date=22 December 2022 |url-status=live}}
* {{cite web |magazine=Billboard |title=Billboard Canadian Hot 100: Week of March 26, 2022 |url=https://www.billboard.com/charts/canadian-hot-100/2022-03-26/ |access-date=11 February 2023 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230211220424/https://www.billboard.com/charts/canadian-hot-100/2022-03-26/ |archive-date=11 February 2023 |url-status=live}}</ref> The song also reached the top position on the [[Billboard charts#Canadian charts|Canada AC, CHR/Top 40 and Hot AC]] rankings, respectively.<ref name="Canada AC" /><ref name="Canada CHR" /><ref name="Canada HAC" /> In October 2022, it received a septuple platinum certification from [[Music Canada]] (MC) for shifting more than 560,000 units in the Canada.<ref name="Canada Cert" /> In the United States, "Cold Heart (Pnau remix)" entered the [[Billboard Hot 100|''Billboard'' Hot 100]] at number 81 on 28 August 2021 and rose to number 32 in its fifth week, giving John the longest span of top 40 Hot 100 appearances, excluding holiday fare.<ref name="United States" /><ref>{{cite magazine |last=Trust |first=Gary |magazine=Billboard |title=Elton John Extends Span of Top 40 Hot 100 Hits to 50 Years, Thanks to 'Cold Heart' With Dua Lipa |url=https://www.billboard.com/pro/elton-john-top-40-hot-100-span-cold-heart/ |access-date=12 February 2023 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220906124948/https://www.billboard.com/pro/elton-john-top-40-hot-100-span-cold-heart/ |archive-date=6 September 2022 |date=12 October 2021 |url-access=subscription |url-status=dead}}</ref> The song reached its summit at number 7 on the ranking issue dated 15 January 2022, earning Lipa's fourth top 10 single on the chart and John's 28th entry.<ref name="United States" /><ref>{{cite magazine |last=Trust |first=Gary |magazine=Billboard |title=Adele Back Atop Hot 100, 'Bruno,' Elton John & Dua Lipa, Kodak Black Hit Top 10 |url=https://www.billboard.com/music/chart-beat/adele-bruno-encanto-elton-john-dua-lipa-kodak-black-hot-100-1235017217/ |access-date=12 February 2023 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230126202310/https://www.billboard.com/music/chart-beat/adele-bruno-encanto-elton-john-dua-lipa-kodak-black-hot-100-1235017217/ |archive-date=26 January 2023 |date=10 January 2022 |url-status=live}}</ref> Topping the [[Adult Contemporary (chart)|Adult Contemporary]] and [[Adult Top 40]] rankings,<ref name="BADC" /><ref name="BADP" /> it further peaked at number one on the [[Dance/Electronic Songs|Hot Dance/Electronic Songs]] chart, logging its 34th week at the top on 11 June.<ref name="BHDE" /><ref>{{cite magazine |last=Murray |first=Gordon |magazine=Billboard |title=Elton John & Dua Lipa's 'Cold Heart' Hits New Milestone Atop Hot Dance/Electronic Songs Chart |url=https://www.billboard.com/pro/elton-john-dua-lipa-cold-heart-tops-hot-dance-electronic-songs-chart-milestone/ |access-date=12 February 2023 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220928002557/https://www.billboard.com/pro/elton-john-dua-lipa-cold-heart-tops-hot-dance-electronic-songs-chart-milestone/ |archive-date=28 September 2022 |date=9 June 2022 |url-access=subscription |url-status=dead}}</ref> In May 2022, the song garnered a double certification from the [[Recording Industry Association of America]] (RIAA) in the US for selling more than 2,000,000 units.<ref name="United States Cert" />

"Cold Heart (Pnau remix)" reached the top position in Bulgaria,<ref name="Bulgaria" /> the [[Commonwealth of Independent States]] (CIS),<ref name="CIS" /> Croatia,<ref name="Croatia" /> the Czech Republic,<ref name="Czech Republic" /> Iceland,<ref name="Iceland" /> Lithuania,<ref name="Lithuania" /> Mexico,<ref name="Mexico" /> Poland, Ukraine and [[Wallonia]].<ref name="Poland" /><ref name="Ukraine">{{cite web |publisher=TopHit |title=Top Radio Hits Ukraine Weekly Chart: 1 April 2022{{spaced ndash}}7 April 2022 |url=https://tophit.ru/en/chart/ukraine/weekly/2022-04-01/all/all |access-date=5 February 2023 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230205153646/https://tophit.ru/en/chart/ukraine/weekly/2022-04-01/all/all |archive-date=5 February 2023 |date=1 April 2022 |url-status=live}}</ref><ref name="Wallonia" /> Top 10 positions were also achieved in Austria,<ref name="Austria" /> Costa Rica,<ref name="Costa Rica" /> Denmark,<ref name="Denmark" /> El Salvador,<ref name="El Salvador">{{cite web |publisher=Monitor Latino |title=Top 20 El Salvador: Del 20 al 26 de Septiembre, 2021 |url=http://charts.monitorlatino.com/top20/Print/El%20Salvador/General/20210920 |access-date=5 February 2023 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230205154318/http://charts.monitorlatino.com/top20/Print/El%20Salvador/General/20210920 |archive-date=5 February 2023 |language=es |date=20 September 2021 |url-status=live}}</ref> [[Flanders]],<ref name="Flanders" /> France,<ref name="France" /> Germany,<ref name="Germany" /> Greece,<ref name="Greece" /> Hungary,<ref name="Hungary" /> Ireland,<ref name="Ireland" /> Italy,<ref name="Italy" /> Luxembourg,<ref name="Luxembourg" /> the Netherlands,<ref name="Netherlands" /> Norway,<ref name="Norway" /> Portugal,<ref name="Portugal" /> Romania,<ref name="Romania" /> Russia,<ref name="Russia">{{cite web |publisher=TopHit |title=Top Radio Hits Russia Weekly Chart: 04 February 2022{{spaced ndash}}10 February 2022 |url=https://tophit.com/chart/top/radio/hits/ru/weekly/20220204-20220210 |access-date=11 July 2024 |date=4 February 2022 |url-status=dead |archive-date=11 July 2024 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240711045919/https://tophit.com/chart/top/radio/hits/ru/weekly/20220204-20220210 }}</ref> Slovakia,<ref name="Slovakia" /> South Africa,<ref name="South Africa" /> Sweden, Switzerland and Uruguay.<ref name="Sweden" /><ref name="Switzerland" /><ref name="Uruguay">{{cite web |publisher=Monitor Latino |title=Top 20 Uruguay: Del 27 de Diciembre 2021 al 2 de Enero 2022 |url=http://charts.monitorlatino.com/top20/print/Uruguay/General/20211227 |access-date=5 February 2023 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230205152859/http://charts.monitorlatino.com/top20/print/Uruguay/General/20211227 |archive-date=5 February 2023 |language=es |date=27 December 2021 |url-status=live}}</ref> The song received a gold [[Music recording certification|certifications]] from [[IFPI Greece]] in Greece and [[International Federation of the Phonographic Industry|IFPI Switzerland]] in Switzerland.<ref name="Greece Cert" /><ref name="Switzerland Cert" /> It was certified double platinum in Denmark,<ref name="Denmark Cert" /> Mexico<ref name="Mexico Cert" /> and Norway<ref name="Norway Cert" /> as well as triple platinum in Austria,<ref name="Austria Cert" /> Italy,<ref name="Italy Cert" /> Portugal,<ref name="Portugal Cert" /> and Sweden,<ref name="Sweden Cert" /> and six-times Platinum in Spain.<ref name="Spain Cert" /> The song further garnered a diamond certification from the [[Syndicat National de l'Édition Phonographique]] (SNEP) in France and the [[Polish Society of the Phonographic Industry]] (ZPAV) in Poland.<ref name="France Cert" /><ref name="Poland Cert" />

